@startuml 01_PENA_Vision_and_Identity
title PENA-Agent — Vision and Identity

skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam rectangle {
  BorderColor #2F5597
  BackgroundColor #F8FBFF
}
skinparam component {
  BorderColor #2F5597
  BackgroundColor #F8FBFF
}
skinparam note {
  BorderColor #999999
  BackgroundColor #FFFBEA
}
skinparam ArrowColor #444444
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 14

rectangle "PENA-Agent" as PENA {
  rectangle "Humans + AI + Agents" as HumansAgents
  rectangle "Personal Epistemic\nNews Aggregator" as PENACore
  rectangle "AI-Assisted\nEngineering Laboratory" as Lab
  rectangle "Observability\nand Learning Loops" as Obs
  rectangle "SDLC2\nValidation Environment" as Validation
  rectangle "Knowledge-Centric\nEngineering" as Knowledge

  HumansAgents --> PENACore : collaborates with
  PENACore --> Lab : validates
  Obs --> Validation : feedback
  Lab --> Validation : experiments
  Validation --> Knowledge : evolves toward
}

note right of PENACore
PENA-Agent is intentionally both:
• a useful AI-agent system
• an SDLC2 engineering experiment
end note

@enduml
